From afeb8ce28188c9a1fab0976884581c774659b702 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: mediatek: add the MT6897 stateful VCP encoder

Expose the MT6897 stateful H.264/HEVC encoder with committed controls,
bounded geometry, frame/power ownership and opt-in diagnostic APIs,
including force-intra.

